        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sam Claflin, Emilia Clarke, Woody Harrelson, Sean Bean, Corey Sevier, Steve Peacocke, Jenna Coleman, Charles Dance, Matthew Lewis, Janet McTeer, Vanessa Kirby, Joanna Lumley, Thea Sharrock, Jojo Moyes\n- Products: Me Before You, The Hunger Games film series, The Lost Future, White Men Can't Jump, Kingpin, The Cowboy Way, Zombieland, Natural Born Killers, The People vs. Larry Flynt, A Prairie Home Companion, Now You See Me, War for the Planet of the Apes\n- Roles: Finnick Odair, Philip Swift, Will Traynor, Haymitch Abernathy, Billy Hoyle, Roy Munson, Pepper Lewis, Tallahassee, Mickey Knox, Larry Flynt, Dusty, Merritt McKinney, the Colonel\n\nFacts:\n- Jojo Moyes wrote the 2012 novel Me Before You.\n- Me Before You is a 2016 romantic drama film directed by Thea Sharrock in her directorial debut and adapted by Jojo Moyes from her 2012 novel of the same name.\n- Me Before You stars Emilia Clarke, Sam Claflin, Steve Peacocke, Jenna Coleman, Charles Dance, Matthew Lewis, Janet McTeer, Vanessa Kirby, and Joanna Lumley.\n- Sam Claflin is known for portraying Finnick Odair in The Hunger Games film series and Will Traynor in Me Before You.\n- Sam Claflin, Sean Bean, and Corey Sevier star in The Lost Future.\n- Woody Harrelson portrayed Billy Hoyle in White Men Can't Jump, Roy Munson in Kingpin, Pepper Lewis in The Cowboy Way, Mickey Knox in Natural Born Killers, Larry Flynt in The People vs. Larry Flynt, Dusty in A Prairie Home Companion, Tallahassee in Zombieland, Haymitch Abernathy in The Hunger Games film series, Merritt McKinney in Now You See Me, and the Colonel in War for the Planet of the Apes.",
